sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Producer
  participant C as RenderController
  participant S as RenderService
  participant J as RenderJobRepository
  participant K as Render worker
  participant O as MinIO
  participant A as ClipArtifactService
  P->>C: POST /render/projects/{id}/start (resolution)
  C->>S: start(projectId, req, user)
  S->>S: No running job, not published, freeze composition
  S->>J: save(RenderJob QUEUED), video RENDERING
  S->>K: enqueue(job, props, width, height, fps, voice)
  S-->>C: RenderJobResponse
  K->>K: Bundle FE entry, TTS, renderMedia
  K->>O: Upload MP4
  K->>C: POST /render/callback (service key)
  C->>S: applyCallback(status, videoUrl)
  alt COMPLETED
    S->>A: recordCompleted(job)
    S->>J: video IN_QA, videoUrl set
  else FAILED
    S->>S: handleFailure, retry up to 3 attempts
  end
